# Q23 Where does credit sit: on the Party, the account, or the Payer? (on the account; a credit roll-up relationship counts one role's exposure under another's)
PREFIX party: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/party/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?credit ?rollup WHERE {
  party:creditTerms rdfs:domain party:CustomerAccount ; skos:definition ?credit .
  <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/party/relationship-type/credit-roll-up> skos:definition ?rollup .
}
